  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.1 introduces several zero-allocation and performance optimizations: ReadOnlySpan<char>-based alternate lookup in Excel shared strings with a new span cell writer API, modernized multi-schema source-generated CSV dispatching with dynamic header resolution (reflection-free and 100% Native AOT compatible), and write-path AVX-512 character scanning. Full changelog: https://github.com/KoalaFacts/HeroParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
